red Serpent, Zotz and the Ful\u00f4 Witches. &lt;- You need to think about whether you already include this or actually expect it to be in the game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf0c Rich and immersive lore that blends spirituality, nature and ancestry.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf3f If you enjoy games like Hades, Risk of Rain 2 or Dead Cells, you will find in Madora a unique and visceral experience, with its own identity and deep roots in national mythology.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400300/extras/539e82aca62d37c668976cd70af5119d.poster.avif?t=1769177494\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400300/extras/539e82aca62d37c668976cd70af5119d.webm?t=1769177494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400300/extras/539e82aca62d37c668976cd70af5119d.mp4?t=1769177494\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf81 Add to your Wishlist now!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All those who add will receive an exclusive skin at launch, as well as a special debut discount.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf00 The forest is watching you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you hear Madora's call?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400300/extras/5b37a1c64114d4a14013ee4ccd1a2780.poster.avif?t=1769177494\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400300/extras/5b37a1c64114d4a14013